{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9f247e98cc15bcffa5338f70eeb93cdae587832ebb78794e1b313ff24a8b5a03", "ja": "（今日は仮装ライブ。アイドル達には公演途中の衣装\n替えで、仮装衣装を披露してもらうことになっている）", "zh": "（今天是变装演唱会。偶像们会在演出中途换装时，展示变装服装）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "37ce6f55b0fefcd61b8533c7e6c16cda482e297595410efe4186dc6d6225fc79", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせいたしました。\n今日の私の仮装衣装、ようやく決まりました。", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了。\n我今天的变装服装终于决定好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "1aba5db9a967b3800f6b75b0f459971750fcfb5871e239b23e77e9b799220428", "ja": "どれもゆにーくなものばかりで\nつい迷ってしまいましたが……。", "zh": "每一件都很有特色，让我不由得犹豫了起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f8e6bf76aac4e33c7c122592d64a05cbc0ba2f830d71d9364cb77196c18521f2", "ja": "そうか、気に入るのが見つかったなら良かったよ。\nちなみに、どれを着る予定なんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，能找到你喜欢的就好。\n顺便问一下，你打算穿哪一套？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "29a4ed940015fdc722dbac73845e935a4b80fd229a89b104b2df63e1ac6f9473", "ja": "はい。私が選んだ衣装は、ずばり……猫です！", "zh": "是的。我选中的服装就是……猫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6c1326ea82f90c073c9c2a944317fdd82ea861999debd82ca1eaaa5bfe4a5f1d", "ja": "猫の衣装……？\nそんなの置いてあったかな？", "zh": "猫咪的服装……？\n有那种服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "66500a8e540ae14c3244557e0f9d8adde8818e6b7f43ad7935c96fa68c4e12d8", "ja": "はい、ずんぐりとした猫の衣装がありました。\nまるで、大きなぬいぐるみのような……。", "zh": "是的，有一套矮墩墩的猫咪服装。\n简直就像一个大号玩偶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aba0a145053978cdfba40298942d668b670cbca2c4918c0c1a6c2dad0f5294f8", "ja": "（……着ぐるみのことか！？）", "zh": "（……是说玩偶装吗！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "8b6309babeb0e9e2c175dc8b3b5485909032c739c572760975a9fe8ea4d88da2", "ja": "やはり、アイドルに最も必要なのは愛嬌。\nそして、愛らしさだと思うのです。", "zh": "我认为，偶像最需要的果然还是亲和力。\n以及可爱之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "327b39271023feb2a80f895adfaf634e7e7cf92be11ee317425062fb821c5495", "ja": "その点において、あの衣装は完璧かと……。\nお客様方も、さぞ喜んでくださることでしょう。", "zh": "在这一点上，那套服装可谓完美……客人们想必也会非常开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fe273f046c06527a4161e020e2b5bf7606c1758526cffbb83480d87c1904316e", "ja": "い、いや……あれはスタッフさん用の着ぐるみで、\nアイドルが着たら、誰だかわからなくなるから……。", "zh": "不、不是……那是给工作人员穿的人偶服，\n要是偶像穿上的话，就看不出是谁了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "5fd298802d0f35dd8c625c3f6f98d5729534d0adb16b20961db26142e22359f3", "ja": "なんと……いけませんでしたか……。\nそうですか……。", "zh": "什么……不行吗……。\n这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2fab90666bd943dc4876b2010274b84a52841d8120cc5137093745a470892245", "ja": "ご、ごめんな。なんかものすごく、\nガッカリさせてしまったみたいで。", "zh": "对、对不起……好像让你特别失望了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "4705b61c4128b1db0a550b2966f6a6163341f11531e7b01dd4fd8252c7fc21c6", "ja": "いえ……。問題ありません。実は、このようなことも\nあろうかと……第二候補も選んでおきました。", "zh": "不……没关系的。其实，妾身料想到可能会\n发生这种事……所以还挑选了第二套备选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "95720fc91a936a690a42d969cf22565d71f069c55103c54d720daea71a7654c1", "ja": "おっ、さすが貴音！　何の衣装なんだ？", "zh": "哦，不愧是贵音！是什么服装？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "b9f6dccc4b9bd4e6e2f0d3233f23dd4a964e8ca43599ba5b010865c01b63a86e", "ja": "はい、茜に良く似た人形です。", "zh": "是的，是一个很像茜的人偶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e9a2cc22911bf6ca363c30fbf7e2b645970e9ecd4fc90334e30fd02e234f9d0c", "ja": "同じだ！　確かに茜かもしれない～ぐらいは思って\nもらえそうだが、実は茜じゃなくて貴音だから同じだ！", "zh": "这完全一样嘛！就算人家可能会觉得“说不定确实是茜吧～”，但实际上不是茜而是贵音，所以根本没两样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "afeb929311dad81a9af20d80018ec2ce09c701436f56186e6ad0000de68b48d0", "ja": "なんと……またしても……。\nとても愛らしかったのですが……そうですか……。", "zh": "没想到……又是这样……。\n明明那么可爱……原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "13c7b864a84f2b4e1206cf2ecb5fccd8e584746fe6325ec5c29dcb322651e1bd", "ja": "（そんなに着たかったのか……）", "zh": "（原来你那么想穿啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9b8edaf7dfe834db37f2dd12e4ceb328fa868f2f9ba0e3836dc3f2d3e43c3470", "ja": "……わかった。じゃあ、こうしないか？\n頭は出したままで、身体だけその着ぐるみにするとか。", "zh": "……我知道了。那不如这样吧？\n把头露在外面，只在身上穿那个玩偶装怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "b68d0e16df44a3dd3c718faca3cf466e04533eaeafa280020a2169f2107fc54d", "ja": "頭は出したまま……。それはいささか、\n画竜点睛を欠くことになりませんか？", "zh": "一直露着头……这样一来，岂不是会有画龙点睛之笔欠缺之憾吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1021_p", "source_sha256": "606123b59245a4e623654503659f436616f02ca96a42ee7d2bb1aaa30419cf41", "ja": "いや、むしろ逆だと思うよ。今のその、\nヴァンパイアの気品にあふれた妖艶な貴音が……。", "zh": "不，我觉得反倒恰恰相反。现在这样、\n充满吸血鬼的高贵气质又妖娆的贵音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1022_p", "source_sha256": "df14e6d1bc8948e2adad4cf61defd0350758fb7a0ef90ebd889e115c1d46f7a5", "ja": "身体だけ真逆に愛らしくなることで、両方際立つんだ。\n……うん、よく考えたら本当にいける気がして来た！", "zh": "只是身体变得截然相反的可爱，就能让两边的特点都更加突出。……嗯，仔细想想，真的感觉可行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "eacf730664a6407f1e6893465e519e2b2b5d4f7d9bf0c2a99a1d9c4c162fd8d9", "ja": "まあ、なんとお見事なご発案……！\nさすがです、あなた様！", "zh": "哎呀，真是极其绝妙的提议……！\n不愧是您，殿下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "1494c72019663a4fc2d350bdad1a9a8f6240a7df40ed26bf8a4236bbcf2a1466", "ja": "では、のちに着替える、\n猫の愛らしさを際立たせるためにも……。", "zh": "那么，之后也要换上能凸显猫咪可爱之处的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "88b3ede6cd00df72543053c642f36accaff1906578921e5abb96e5fe0706f2da", "ja": "それまではばんぱいあとして、どこまでも高貴で、\nそして妖しい舞台を御覧に入れましょう。ふふっ……♪", "zh": "在那之前，就请以吸血鬼的身份，为您献上一场无比高贵而又妖异的舞台吧。呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0124_1026_p", "source_sha256": "59c03e92c8e018c774623e06d6d9ec3be267ec53143fff8850c9afe9e0f86e92", "ja": "（その瞳に本気の、妖艶な光が宿っている……。\n目的の順序はともかく、いい仮装公演になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（那双眼中寄宿着认真的、妖艳的光芒……。姑且不论目的的先后顺序，看来会是一场很棒的变装公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
